    "notes": "Retained Q3397701/way168134458 and the November 9 carriageway and sidewalk traces establish the signed frame. +X points northeast toward Lungarno Vespucci. +Z points southeast toward central Florence. The 163.187 m mapped envelope locates the crossing and the four projecting pier noses. The reported 22.5 m width sets the main deck. Photos guide the shallow concrete haunches, masonry dressing, and green railings. The coarse Terrarium grid undersamples the elevated quay roads and yields steep approach support faces. Deck grades, pier foundations, the southwest sidewalk flare, and the northeast lane plate are visual fit decisions. Physical device performance remains unmeasured."
  },
